# Normalize line endings: store text files with LF in the repo, and let Git
# check them out with the platform's native endings. Silences the recurring
# "LF will be replaced by CRLF" warnings on Windows.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Treat common binary assets as binary so Git never touches their bytes.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
